16
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:15,920
(Dalam Ingatan)

17
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,040
Kau datang cari aku.

18
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:18,920
Apa-apa hal, kita cakap di luar.

19
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,520
Kau fikir kau siapa?

20
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,480
Kenapa aku perlu dengar cakap kau?

21
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:35,520
Berhenti!

22
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,520
Berhenti bergaduh!

23
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,400
Jangan layan orang gila tu.

24
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,080
Dia rosakkan majlis peringatan ibu saya!

25
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:41,960
Pengawal!

26
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,120
Panggil pengawal!

27
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,640
Aku akan buat kau menyesal.

28
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,400
Aku takkan lepaskan kamu semua!

29
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,200
Dia datang cari saya.

30
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,520
Saya tak sangka dia rosakkan
majlis peringatan ibu awak

31
